OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC admits improper use of
OL,4,Apolice powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police constable has admitted
OL,7,Fimproper use of police powers over
OL,8,Fcontact he made with a vulnerable
OL,9,Fwitness he met as part of his duties.
OL,11,FHoward Bradley, of Doveridge,
OL,12,FDerbyshire, pleaded guilty to corrupt
OL,13,For improper exercise of police powers
OL,14,Fand privileges by a constable at
OL,15,FStoke-on-Trent Court on Tuesday.
OL,17,FBradley, who worked at Burton Police
OL,18,FStation, was arrested in March 2024 and
OL,19,Fimmediately suspended, said
OL,20,FStaffordshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
